        "id": 1000835
      },
      "writtenOn": "2017-05-02T01:51:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In normal operation with a well-behaved app, this should never be null, right? If so, instead of just silently continuing when sock_tag_entry-\u003elist.next is null, can you warn? Either put it in the previous pr_warn_once or add it to its own pr_warn_once.",
